Synthetic scorer self-test case: import-equals-require

Task: T1 (score.ts --task T1)
Rules: S2, S6

Scenario
src/payments/service.ts adds `import orderRepo = require("../orders/repository")` and calls orderRepo.updateOrderStatus().

Expected
One CRITICAL_DIRECT runtime finding. S2 covers ImportEqualsDeclaration with require and takes the symbol from the member access. tsc_ok is false: with --module esnext, tsc rejects an import assignment (TS1202), whatever type packages are installed.

Asserted fields are in expected.json; the matcher contract is in ../README.md.

Deliberately not asserted
- critical_direct[].line: The finding could carry either the import line or the member-access line.
